{"t":17242,"type":"node.request","node":"explainer","to":"assets","what":"[curious] What if your kart race had *punching*?\nThree laps take you through two *towering loops*.\nThen comes a twenty-four metre *drop*.\nEight riders fight with *gloves*.\nA punch shoves rivals *sideways* and slows them.\nFour classes bring *different attacks*.\n[excited] That's *Zapwick Rush*.\nPick your class, fight, and finish three laps *first* to win the trophy.\n[whispers] Play it on *PC*.","requestId":"q3"}
