{"t":27041,"type":"node.request","node":"ad-image-unity-players","to":"assets","what":"Zapwick Rush: Unity players can play Zapwick Rush as a PC or browser build, mastering towering loops and glowing hover sections while timed electric dashes and careful shots turn eight-rider chaos into a race for the lead. The game is a kart racing game: show karts racing on a track with loops, twists, glowing hover sections, never people on foot, motorbikes or cars. The kart: One low-poly kart body with a broad wedge nose, rounded side pods, a recessed bucket seat and a short rear fin. Use glossy paint tinted to the assigned kart color, cream nose stripes, charcoal seat padding and brushed silver trim; include no driver and no wheels., in colours like #ff593e, #28cfff, #ffe047. The rider sitting in it: One low-poly humanoid figure in a seated pose with both arms reaching forward, with no vehicle. Use warm brown skin, a cyan padded suit, yellow lightning-shaped chest trim, oversized charcoal gloves and a rounded cyan helmet with a solid yellow crest; materials are matte fabric, rubber and glossy pa. Humanoid riders have large padded gloves, rounded helmets and expressive faces. Keep class clothing clearly visible above the kart body.. Sky #87dfff, ground #70cf79; a bright, chunky, toy-like 3D game look. An advertising key visual for Unity players: bold, bright, one clear subject, room at the top for a headline. No text, no letters, no logos, no watermark. No pink or magenta.","requestId":"q6"}
